{
  "id": "E340",
  "title": "Deposit or Withdraw Money",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-07-07",
  "synopsis": "Words you might need in a bank.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1090/c8a9ad98555ea3b2a73abc81f80e2ba4512b825d.mp3?1561665812",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "存钱还是取钱？\n\n小乐：我出去一趟，没现金了，去银行取点钱。\n保罗：那你能帮我存一下钱吗？\n小乐：好的，存到你中国银行的账户吗？\n保罗：对。\n小乐：你要存多少？\n保罗：存两千。你等一下，我去拿钱给你。",
    "traditional": "存錢還是取錢？\n\n小樂：我出去一趟，沒現金了，去銀行取點錢。\n保羅：那你能幫我存一下錢嗎？\n小樂：好的，存到你中國銀行的賬戶嗎？\n保羅：對。\n小樂：你要存多少？\n保羅：存兩千。你等一下，我去拿錢給你。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "To Deposit or Withdraw Money?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐：我出去一趟，没现金了，去银行取点钱。",
      "traditional": "小樂：我出去一趟，沒現金了，去銀行取點錢。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè wǒ chū qù yí tàng méi xiàn jīn le qù yín háng qǔ diǎn qián",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: I need to go out for a while, I don’t have any cash, I‘m going to the bank to withdraw some money."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "保罗：那你能帮我存一下钱吗？",
      "traditional": "保羅：那你能幫我存一下錢嗎？",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó nà nǐ néng bāng wǒ cún yí xià qián ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Then can you help me a bit and deposit money?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐：好的，存到你中国银行的账户吗？",
      "traditional": "小樂：好的，存到你中國銀行的賬戶嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hǎo de cún dào nǐ zhōng guó yín háng de zhàng hù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: Sure, deposit it into your account at Bank of China?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "保罗：对。",
      "traditional": "保羅：對。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó duì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Yes."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小乐：你要存多少？",
      "traditional": "小樂：你要存多少？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè nǐ yào cún duō shao",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Le: How much do you want to deposit?"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "保罗：存两千。你等一下，我去拿钱给你。",
      "traditional": "保羅：存兩千。你等一下，我去拿錢給你。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó cún liǎng qiān nǐ děng yí xià wǒ qù ná qián gěi nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Paul: Two thousand. Wait a moment, I'll go get the money and give it to you."
    }
  ],
